#: data/scripts/gift_pichu.inc:61
msgctxt "sText_MysteryGiftEgg"
msgid ""
"Thank you for using the MYSTERY\n"
"GIFT System.\p"
"From the POKéMON CENTER we\n"
"have a gift--a POKéMON EGG!\p"
"Please raise it with love and\n"
"kindness.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用神秘礼物系统。\p"
"宝可梦中心送来了礼物——\n"
"一颗宝可梦的蛋！\p"
"请用爱心和温柔\n"
"把它养大。$"

#: data/scripts/gift_pichu.inc:69
msgctxt "sText_FullParty"
msgid ""
"Oh, your party appears to be full.\p"
"Please come see me after storing\n"
"a POKéMON on a PC.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你的队伍好像已经满了。\p"
"请把宝可梦存到电脑里\n"
"之后再来找我吧。$"
